<%# Where the patient stands on each tier, from BOTH sources side by side:
    what the patient answered (testimony) and what the centre recorded
    (measurement). Shared by the patient page and the assessment page.

    Replaced _self_report_summary on 2026-10-19. That box stated the declared
    half in a sentence and everything under it counted only recorded values, so
    a patient who answered every question opened to "Evaluación incompleta" and
    a row of zeros — and partners testing the questionnaire read it as their
    answers having been lost. The two columns are never added together: a
    declaration is enough for the triage step and never for the clinical one,
    which is what the note says.

    The patient's column is always there; with no answers it says "Sin
    respuestas" rather than disappearing (2026-10-19). Locals:
      recorded — the patient's eligibility_result (recorded values)
      declared — the patient's self_report_result, or nil
%>
<% show_declared = declared.present? %>
<% candidate = t("patients.states.candidate") %>
<% potential = t("patients.states.potential") %>
<% tiers = [ [ :basic, t("criteria_assessments.tiers.basic_gate", candidate: candidate) ],
             [ :specific, t("criteria_assessments.tiers.specific_gate", potential: potential) ] ]
             .select { |tier, _| recorded.public_send("#{tier}_total_count").positive? } %>
<% if tiers.any? %>
  <div class="table-responsive <%= show_declared ? "mb-1" : "mb-3" %>">
    <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-1 evidence-by-tier">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col"><%= t("criteria_assessments.tiers.level") %></th>
          <% if show_declared %>
            <th scope="col" class="bg-info-subtle"><%= t("criteria_assessments.tiers.declared") %></th>
          <% end %>
          <th scope="col"><%= t("criteria_assessments.tiers.recorded") %></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% tiers.each do |tier, gate| %>
          <tr data-tier="<%= tier %>">
            <th scope="row">
              <%= t("criteria_assessments.tiers.#{tier}") %>
              <div class="small text-muted fw-normal"><%= gate %></div>
            </th>
            <% if show_declared %>
              <td class="bg-info-subtle" data-source="declared">
                <%= tier_evidence(declared, tier, empty: t("criteria_assessments.tiers.no_answers")) %>
              </td>
            <% end %>
            <td data-source="recorded">
              <%= tier_evidence(recorded, tier, empty: t("criteria_assessments.tiers.not_recorded")) %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <% if show_declared %>
    <p class="small text-muted mb-3"><%= t("criteria_assessments.tiers.note", candidate: candidate, potential: potential) %></p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
